Function typing bug (see jdy's blog, 2005-10-24)
(fun (x,y) { [x] ++ [y] }) ([1],"a")
stderr : @.*Type error: Type does not match the required type.*In expression:.*\[x\] \+\+ \[y\]\.
exit : 1
args : --fresco

Type annotations on functions
fun (x) { x } : (String) -> String
stdout : fun : (String) -> String
args : --fresco

Incorrect type annotations rejected
fun (x) { x + 1 } : (Float) -> String
stderr : @.*Type error: Type does not match the required type.*In expression: x \+ 1\.
exit : 1
args : --fresco

Loose type annotations on functions
fun (x) { x } : (b) -> b
stdout : fun : (a) -> a
args : --fresco

